    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;if it is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;matrix</p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>adj</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>28</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>14</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>14</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>14</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>14</mn></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math></p>"
